      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In recent years laparoscopic surgery has reached a crucial role in the surgical approach of both abdominal and thoracic pathologies. A diffused as elective surgery, its utilization has become necessary even in emergency surgery, both as diagnostic approach as curative aim. In this work the purpose of the Authors is to show their own experience in a six years period in the laparoscopic treatment of abdominal emergencies."},
